  intros l t Hst p j E.
  apply (fire_of_run_instr tm Cc true true l B0_0RB1RA_1LC0RA_1LD0LD_1LA0LC p j [] []);
    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_0RB1RA_1LC0RA_1LD0LD_1LA0LC p j E)].
Qed.


